{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-01-04 10:00:00', 'title': 'IBM LAUNCHES NEW WAY TO PARTNER THROUGH IBM PARTNER PLUS', 'text': 'OFFERS ENHANCED INCENTIVES, ACCESS AND SUPPORT TO HELP NEW AND EXISTING PARTNERS WIN WITH CLIENTS ARMONK, N.Y. , JAN. 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED IBM PARTNER PLUS, A NEW PROGRAM THAT REIMAGINES HOW IBM ENGAGES WITH ITS BUSINESS PARTNERS THROUGH UNPRECEDENTED ACCESS TO IBM RESOURCES, INCENTIVES AND TAILORED SUPPORT TO DEEPEN THEIR TECHNICAL EXPERTISE AND HELP SPEED TIME TO MARKET.'}